## `strip_wrappers`

``` hol4
markerLib.strip_wrappers : thm -> thm
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Removes the requirement and bound wrappers from a theorem-list argument.

The `Req0`, `ReqD`, `Once` and `Ntimes` wrappers are carried as
hypotheses. `strip_wrappers th` removes all of them, however nested,
leaving the theorem they wrap. A theorem without these wrappers is
returned unchanged.

### Failure

Never fails.

### Example

``` hol4
>> markerLib.strip_wrappers (simpLib.Req0 (Once (ASSUME “p:bool”)));
```

### See also

[`BoundedRewrites.Once`](#BoundedRewrites.Once),
[`markerLib.Split`](#markerLib.Split).
